# Godot's per-project editor cache. Regenerated whenever the project is
# opened, machine-specific, never source.
#
# The `*.uid` sidecars Godot 4.4+ writes beside each script are deliberately
# NOT ignored: they carry stable script identities that scenes and resources
# reference by UID, so they belong in version control. A fresh clone that
# regenerated its own would break those references.
.godot/
